WEBVTT

01:37.950 --> 01:43.000
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.250 --> 01:43.580
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.680 --> 01:45.990
[Episode 1]

01:46.020 --> 01:47.500
[Bugui Manor]

01:53.070 --> 01:56.640
What is a fleeting beauty worth?

01:57.200 --> 02:01.310
Accompany your lord into a drunken dream.

02:04.070 --> 02:07.510
Shattering like glass at 16;

02:08.310 --> 02:13.310
your body
light as sorrowful falling flowers.

02:18.680 --> 02:23.700
[Fragrance fades and jade is lost;
the withered blood case]

03:07.400 --> 03:08.150
In Tianhuang City,

03:08.150 --> 03:09.870
9 young girls
have gone missing one after another.

03:09.870 --> 03:10.910
Witnesses say

03:10.910 --> 03:12.150
the one who abducted the girls

03:12.150 --> 03:13.750
carries a puppet about three feet tall.

03:12.860 --> 03:16.020
[Shi Dynasty capital, Tianhuang City]

03:14.120 --> 03:15.870
Now the Divine Constable Bureau
is to dispatch more personnel

03:15.870 --> 03:17.030
to search the entire territory.

03:16.740 --> 03:18.680
[Tianhuang City Divine Constable Bureau]

03:17.030 --> 03:17.910
There must be no mistakes!

03:17.910 --> 03:18.590
Yes, Sir.

03:18.750 --> 03:19.560
Set off!

03:20.280 --> 03:22.870
[It has been 72 years since
the establishment of Shi Empire,]

03:22.340 --> 03:26.110
[Chief Constable's Hall]

03:22.890 --> 03:24.220
[Spanning 3 emperors.]

03:24.600 --> 03:27.720
[Emperor Wuzong conquered
Northern Kun and Nanrong.]

03:27.960 --> 03:28.940
[He then headed west]

03:28.940 --> 03:31.720
[and annihilated Liluo
and unified the world.]

03:32.220 --> 03:34.650
[In order to protect the capital,
Tianhuang City,]

03:33.100 --> 03:34.560
[Divine Constable Bureau]

03:34.940 --> 03:36.750
[Emperor Wuzong of Shi, put in place
the Absolute Heaven and Earth Prohibition]

03:36.750 --> 03:38.980
[through a secret method.]

03:39.280 --> 03:40.520
[With that, within the capital,]

03:40.520 --> 03:42.079
[other than Divine Constable Bureau,]

03:42.079 --> 03:45.290
[all kinds of magic become useless.]

03:46.150 --> 03:48.280
[That's why
the Star-Gathering Pavilion chose]

03:46.329 --> 03:54.110
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]
[Tianhuang City outskirts; best tavern in Great Shi]

03:48.280 --> 03:50.210
[the wilderness of the outskirts]

03:50.280 --> 03:52.750
[so that it won't be under
the jurisdiction of the Absolute Prohibition,]

03:52.750 --> 03:55.120
[and is able to use magic.]

03:54.160 --> 03:56.430
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

03:55.310 --> 03:57.520
[attracting many great nobles]

03:57.520 --> 04:00.310
[to watch all kinds of strange sights.]

04:01.030 --> 04:02.400
[In just 3 years,]

04:02.430 --> 04:03.940
[it became]

04:04.030 --> 04:06.610
[the best tavern in Great Shi.]

04:12.280 --> 04:13.080
Master,

04:13.080 --> 04:14.710
your green plum tea is ready.

04:14.910 --> 04:16.040
Just leave it there.

04:37.170 --> 04:39.780
[Young Master Qingyang, Lisi]

04:42.240 --> 04:43.500
What's wrong, Qing Wu?

04:44.070 --> 04:45.000
Did it scare you?

04:46.830 --> 04:47.630
Master,

04:48.070 --> 04:49.200
everything's fine—

04:49.630 --> 04:50.430
why did you make

04:50.430 --> 04:51.600
such a weird thing?

04:51.920 --> 04:53.360
It looks really scary.

04:54.310 --> 04:55.120
Master,

04:55.270 --> 04:57.040
don't blame me for talking too much,

04:57.040 --> 05:00.650
[Qing Wu]

04:57.159 --> 04:58.270
but I heard

04:58.510 --> 04:59.720
the Divine Constable Bureau

04:59.720 --> 05:01.070
is searching for someone

05:01.070 --> 05:02.630
carrying a puppet doll.

05:03.240 --> 05:03.920
Lest

05:03.920 --> 05:04.680
you be misunderstood

05:04.680 --> 05:05.510
by them

05:05.510 --> 05:06.830
and get arrested.

05:06.950 --> 05:08.550
Hopefully it goes as you say.

05:09.070 --> 05:11.000
I want to be arrested by them.

05:20.780 --> 05:28.920
[Wind and Moon]

05:27.830 --> 05:29.560
So this is what a dragon's like?

05:41.780 --> 05:42.670
Great!

05:42.830 --> 05:43.720
Great!

05:52.830 --> 05:54.490
Wonderful, truly wonderful!

05:54.920 --> 05:57.390
Amazing!

05:58.270 --> 06:00.670
Amazing!

06:01.520 --> 06:03.430
Young Master Qingyang!

06:04.890 --> 06:06.510
Young Master Qingyang!

06:07.120 --> 06:08.450
Young Master Qingyang!

06:09.480 --> 06:10.270
Great!

06:10.680 --> 06:11.480
Impressive!

06:13.560 --> 06:14.360
Qingyang!

06:14.480 --> 06:15.480
Young Master Qingyang!

06:15.480 --> 06:16.270
Impressive!

06:16.430 --> 06:17.760
Young Master Qingyang!

06:19.460 --> 06:22.710
[Wind and Moon]

06:20.120 --> 06:21.240
Young Master Qingyang!

06:21.240 --> 06:22.570
Young Master Qingyang!

06:32.510 --> 06:33.750
A dragon is in the sky,

06:33.870 --> 06:35.430
flying far away.

06:35.830 --> 06:38.070
I am the master
of Star-Gathering Pavilion,

06:38.070 --> 06:40.310
Li Si, Li Qingyang.

06:40.830 --> 06:42.310
I wish you all

06:42.310 --> 06:43.720
wealth and prosperity,

06:44.070 --> 06:45.600
and a long life.

06:45.920 --> 06:47.360
Great!

06:54.680 --> 06:55.800
It disappeared.

07:00.510 --> 07:02.810
Great!

07:02.830 --> 07:05.160
Great!

07:06.720 --> 07:08.180
This round of drinks today

07:08.680 --> 07:10.070
is on me.

07:10.390 --> 07:12.320
Thank you, Young Master Qingyang!

07:14.120 --> 07:14.870
The Star-Gathering Pavilion

07:14.870 --> 07:17.310
is truly
the number one tavern in Great Shi.

07:18.120 --> 07:21.750
It's said the late emperor,
to keep the imperial city safe,

07:22.070 --> 07:23.870
built the supreme mechanism,
Absolute Heaven and Earth Prohibition,

07:23.870 --> 07:26.630
within the valleys surrounding the city.

07:27.360 --> 07:29.830
Because the earth veins are blocked

07:29.950 --> 07:31.750
and the spiritual energy is cut off,

07:31.750 --> 07:34.310
in all of Tianhuang City,

07:34.480 --> 07:36.240
except for the Divine Constable Bureau,

07:36.240 --> 07:38.510
no one can use strange arts.

07:38.390 --> 07:42.240
[Wind and Moon]

07:39.870 --> 07:41.040
It is

07:41.040 --> 07:42.430
indeed safer.

07:42.800 --> 07:43.600
But

07:44.270 --> 07:46.360
where's the fun if you can't use

07:46.630 --> 07:48.070
strange arts?

07:48.070 --> 07:48.950
Yes, exactly!

07:48.950 --> 07:49.870
That's why

07:50.270 --> 07:51.970
I chose to build

07:52.240 --> 07:53.120
Star-Gathering Pavilion

07:53.120 --> 07:54.950
in a remote area in the suburbs.

07:55.270 --> 07:58.000
Thus, not limited by the Prohibition,

07:58.240 --> 07:59.040
there is

07:59.040 --> 08:00.270
the strange scene

08:00.270 --> 08:01.630
you just saw.

08:02.240 --> 08:03.070
Yes.

08:03.240 --> 08:04.560
Thank you for your love.

08:04.560 --> 08:05.720
You all went through the trouble,

08:05.720 --> 08:06.830
traveled over land and water,

08:06.830 --> 08:07.860
and came from afar

08:07.890 --> 08:09.040
to gather together.

08:09.360 --> 08:10.710
Here,

08:11.480 --> 08:13.280
I thank you all for your support.

08:13.510 --> 08:14.680
You are too polite!

08:14.680 --> 08:15.630
Too polite!

08:16.600 --> 08:17.390
Thank you.

08:19.160 --> 08:19.950
Everyone,

08:20.480 --> 08:22.270
in my Star-Gathering Pavilion,

08:22.270 --> 08:23.930
there are not only fun things,

08:24.070 --> 08:25.480
but also delicious food and drinks,

08:25.480 --> 08:26.630
and beautiful sights.

08:26.630 --> 08:27.680
What others have,

08:27.680 --> 08:28.720
I have.

08:28.920 --> 08:30.360
What others don't have,

08:30.430 --> 08:31.510
I also have.

08:32.669 --> 08:35.000
As long as
you are willing to spend silver,

08:35.030 --> 08:36.830
in my Star-Gathering Pavilion,

08:36.870 --> 08:38.030
you can buy

08:38.030 --> 08:39.840
everything you want.

08:39.870 --> 08:42.390
Great!

08:48.120 --> 08:49.630
What about puppet dolls?

08:49.960 --> 08:51.270
Do you have them too?

08:53.910 --> 08:55.240
Isn't this a Divine Constable
from the Divine Constable Bureau?

08:55.240 --> 08:58.270
Why is the Divine Constable Bureau here?

09:00.320 --> 09:01.000
Master.

09:11.550 --> 09:14.770
[Constable Frost]

09:19.170 --> 09:23.390
[Constable Frost, Bai Zhenzhu]

09:21.750 --> 09:23.910
So you are the

09:23.910 --> 09:26.080
famous Young Master Qingyang
in Tianhuang City,

09:26.080 --> 09:26.870
Li Si.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.670
Not only are you good at business,

09:29.670 --> 09:31.930
but your illusion arts are also amazing.

09:31.960 --> 09:33.200
Nice to meet you.

09:34.630 --> 09:37.080
Greetings, Lord Constable Frost.

09:38.480 --> 09:39.560
My Star-Gathering Pavilion

09:39.560 --> 09:41.720
has been open to guests
for over 3 years.

09:41.720 --> 09:42.910
Indeed, there have been

09:42.910 --> 09:44.030
many government officials

09:44.030 --> 09:45.200
who have visited.

09:45.670 --> 09:46.600
But to say,

09:47.030 --> 09:49.080
an official
from the Divine Constable Bureau,

09:49.080 --> 09:51.080
Constable Frost, you are the first.

09:55.550 --> 09:58.010
I apologize
for not welcoming you from afar.

09:58.440 --> 10:00.550
I just heard you say

10:01.270 --> 10:02.910
as long as one is willing to spend silver,

10:02.910 --> 10:03.670
anything can be bought

10:03.670 --> 10:05.530
in the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

10:06.750 --> 10:07.670
I think,

10:07.870 --> 10:09.360
in this huge pavilion,

10:10.320 --> 10:11.550
there must be

10:13.320 --> 10:14.790
puppet dolls, right?

10:19.250 --> 10:20.540
What is that?

10:20.540 --> 10:21.630
A puppet doll.

10:21.870 --> 10:22.870
Puppet dolls?

10:27.840 --> 10:29.240
What you just said

10:29.480 --> 10:31.390
is quite interesting.

10:32.080 --> 10:33.280
To tell you the truth,

10:33.510 --> 10:35.750
guests who come
to my Star-Gathering Pavilion,

10:35.750 --> 10:37.360
besides seeking pleasure,

10:37.440 --> 10:39.240
indeed buy many various things.

10:39.870 --> 10:40.670
But

10:40.840 --> 10:42.000
you're the first

10:42.120 --> 10:42.870
who wants to buy

10:42.870 --> 10:44.510
a puppet doll

10:45.670 --> 10:47.080
straight away.

10:50.000 --> 10:51.000
Your Lordship...

10:54.030 --> 10:55.030
I heard

10:56.240 --> 10:57.840
the Divine Constable Bureau

10:57.870 --> 10:59.600
is recently hunting a criminal

10:59.670 --> 11:01.750
who carries a puppet doll.

11:02.630 --> 11:04.240
You coming to my Star-Gathering Pavilion

11:04.240 --> 11:05.360
to buy a puppet—

11:05.440 --> 11:06.240
could it be that you've

11:06.240 --> 11:07.840
been unable to catch the criminal

11:07.840 --> 11:09.100
and can't report back,

11:09.320 --> 11:10.790
so you want to secretly

11:10.870 --> 11:12.440
buy a similar one

11:12.870 --> 11:14.360
as fake evidence?

11:31.550 --> 11:33.480
Fake evidence alone is not enough.

11:43.440 --> 11:45.200
I need at least a suspect

11:45.510 --> 11:46.840
to report back.

11:55.360 --> 11:56.030
Lord Constable Frost,

11:56.030 --> 11:57.960
why are you staring at me like that?

12:00.440 --> 12:01.600
Do you think

12:02.150 --> 12:04.670
I am a suspect?

12:04.670 --> 12:05.870
It's not impossible.

12:06.870 --> 12:07.670
Master Li,

12:08.270 --> 12:09.030
2 months ago,

12:09.030 --> 12:10.240
you specially ordered a batch

12:10.240 --> 12:11.320
of pigments for painting puppet dolls

12:11.320 --> 12:12.960
to be delivered
to the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

12:12.960 --> 12:14.270
If you didn't paint them yourself,

12:14.270 --> 12:15.730
how could you get it on you?

12:15.840 --> 12:16.550
And this time coincides with

12:16.550 --> 12:17.840
the disappearance of

12:17.840 --> 12:19.700
the first girl in Tianhuang City.

12:19.910 --> 12:20.790
Master Li,

12:21.120 --> 12:22.480
based on this alone,

12:22.840 --> 12:24.440
I have to suspect you.

12:34.060 --> 12:36.060
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

12:34.480 --> 12:35.600
What's going on?

12:35.670 --> 12:36.840
Divine Constable Bureau
on official business!

12:36.840 --> 12:37.630
Out of the way!

12:37.630 --> 12:41.560
Those who obstruct official business
will be executed without mercy.

12:50.890 --> 12:52.170
[Constable Eagle]

12:52.480 --> 12:54.510
I am Lou Tianming, Constable Eagle
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

12:52.680 --> 12:55.760
[Constable Eagle, Lou Tianming]

12:54.870 --> 12:56.730
I am here to apprehend a murderer.

12:56.910 --> 12:58.150
Please cooperate.

13:00.030 --> 13:01.510
Search this place

13:01.550 --> 13:02.670
inside and out!

13:02.910 --> 13:03.570
-Yes!
-Yes!

13:09.960 --> 13:11.870
Master Li, my apologies

13:11.870 --> 13:13.240
for disrupting your business.

13:13.240 --> 13:14.480
We are just doing our job.

13:14.480 --> 13:15.880
I hope you can forgive us.

13:17.910 --> 13:19.150
Greetings,

13:19.670 --> 13:21.080
Constable Eagle.

13:21.840 --> 13:23.240
No need for formalities.

13:23.240 --> 13:24.960
At the Crown Prince's Mid-Autumn banquet
last year,

13:24.960 --> 13:26.820
I had the chance to see your grace.

13:26.870 --> 13:28.790
It is my honor to

13:28.870 --> 13:30.000
see you again today.

13:31.480 --> 13:33.340
You flatter me, Constable Eagle.

13:34.240 --> 13:35.910
My Lords, we found something.

13:44.630 --> 13:45.750
[Yaoguang Pavilion]

13:48.960 --> 13:49.870
My Lords.

13:52.920 --> 13:54.300
A puppet doll?

14:00.840 --> 14:02.170
Young Master Qingyang,

14:02.360 --> 14:04.240
what a beautiful place.

14:04.480 --> 14:05.940
You overpraise, Lord Lou.

14:06.080 --> 14:06.870
This is

14:07.670 --> 14:09.670
merely my living quarters.

14:10.120 --> 14:11.440
Your living quarters?

14:11.550 --> 14:12.810
And you keep this here?

14:17.150 --> 14:18.480
Young Master Qingyang,

14:18.480 --> 14:20.030
how do you explain

14:21.120 --> 14:22.780
this puppet doll in your room?

14:25.150 --> 14:26.480
I usually

14:26.750 --> 14:29.720
like mechanics and contraptions.

14:30.150 --> 14:31.410
I made this puppet doll

14:31.840 --> 14:33.720
in my spare time.

14:38.030 --> 14:38.960
It seems

14:39.670 --> 14:41.390
you two don't believe me.

14:45.960 --> 14:46.750
In that case,

14:47.550 --> 14:48.870
it seems I must

14:48.870 --> 14:51.270
pay a visit
to the Divine Constable Bureau.

14:52.270 --> 14:53.270
In that case,

14:54.150 --> 14:55.360
please do.

15:16.960 --> 15:18.760
[Shangfang Drum]

15:22.790 --> 15:23.960
[Shangfang Drum]

15:23.960 --> 15:25.420
[Divine Constable Bureau]

15:31.230 --> 15:32.970
[Divine Constable Bureau]

15:37.460 --> 15:40.860
[Divine Constable Bureau]

15:38.450 --> 15:40.240
[Great Shi's Divine Constable Bureau]

15:40.240 --> 15:41.890
[was set up on
the 4th of the military expedition—]

15:41.890 --> 15:43.750
[it has now been 46 years
since its establishment.]

15:43.750 --> 15:46.360
[It is independent of the
Three Secretariats and Six Ministries.]

15:46.360 --> 15:48.030
[They are in charge of patrol and arrest,]

15:48.030 --> 15:49.910
[military information,]

15:49.910 --> 15:51.820
[and secret affairs like anti-rebellion.]

15:51.820 --> 15:53.390
[Wherever the Divine Constable Tally is]

15:52.700 --> 15:54.620
[Divine Constable Bureau,
Chief Constable's Hall]

15:53.440 --> 15:55.200
[it is as though the Emperor
is personally present.]

15:54.690 --> 15:56.070
[Clarifying Laws to Guide Virtue]

15:55.240 --> 15:57.030
[Officials of the fifth rank and below]

15:56.110 --> 15:57.710
[Imperial Thunder]

15:57.030 --> 15:59.490
[may be executed first
and reported later.]

16:00.320 --> 16:01.670
My investigation has found

16:01.670 --> 16:03.240
that Young Master Qingyang is named Li Si,

16:03.240 --> 16:04.630
and he was born in the border area.

16:04.630 --> 16:06.030
But the border area
was turbulent at that time,

16:04.920 --> 16:07.070
[Law Prevails]

16:06.120 --> 16:07.600
and many household registrations
were lost.

16:07.600 --> 16:10.430
[Divine Constable Bureau Chief,
Xuanyuan Shan]

16:07.870 --> 16:09.120
The origin of Li Si

16:09.120 --> 16:10.450
is difficult to verify.

16:10.750 --> 16:11.680
Three years ago,

16:11.720 --> 16:13.480
he came to Tianhuang City to do business,

16:13.480 --> 16:14.750
spending money like water.

16:14.750 --> 16:15.630
Throughout the Great Shi,

16:15.630 --> 16:16.480
he opened Star-Gathering Pavilion

16:16.480 --> 16:17.870
and dozens of branches.

16:18.240 --> 16:19.440
He can be said
to be a new wealthy merchant

16:19.440 --> 16:20.670
of the Great Shi Dynasty.

16:20.670 --> 16:22.320
He is in the limelight.

16:22.720 --> 16:23.510
In addition,

16:23.870 --> 16:25.330
this person also has a deep

16:25.720 --> 16:28.320
personal relationship
with the Crown Prince.

16:29.550 --> 16:31.510
According to the existing investigation,

16:31.510 --> 16:32.270
you suspect

16:32.270 --> 16:34.120
that it was Li Si
who manipulated the puppet doll

16:34.120 --> 16:35.440
to abduct the girls?

16:36.510 --> 16:37.840
In my opinion,

16:38.080 --> 16:39.810
I don't think that was the case.

16:39.870 --> 16:41.730
It was through his massive purchase

16:41.730 --> 16:43.480
of oil paint used for painting puppets

16:43.480 --> 16:44.870
that I followed the clues,

16:44.870 --> 16:46.910
finding the Star-Gathering Pavilion,

16:46.910 --> 16:47.750
and subsequently discovered

16:47.750 --> 16:48.870
this puppet doll.

16:49.240 --> 16:50.630
But it's such a big flaw.

16:51.030 --> 16:52.360
If I can think of it,

16:52.670 --> 16:55.120
how could Li Qingyang not?

16:55.360 --> 16:57.030
Since the incident 2 months ago,

16:57.030 --> 16:58.030
he hasn't taken any

16:58.030 --> 16:59.360
precautions or cover-ups.

16:59.360 --> 17:02.360
Isn't he just waiting
for people to come and catch him?

17:04.240 --> 17:05.720
If he is the real culprit,

17:06.920 --> 17:08.180
it doesn't make sense.

17:13.829 --> 17:15.200
Have you ever seen

17:15.550 --> 17:17.550
what the puppet doll in the Bugui Manor

17:17.550 --> 17:18.960
looks like?

17:19.270 --> 17:20.349
I haven't,

17:20.349 --> 17:22.480
but I've heard witness descriptions.

17:23.030 --> 17:25.160
Then how can you be sure

17:25.829 --> 17:28.030
that the one in the Star-Gathering Pavilion

17:28.030 --> 17:29.680
must be the one

17:29.680 --> 17:30.790
in the Bugui Manor?

17:34.830 --> 17:35.790
I can't be sure.

17:36.270 --> 17:37.480
But I'd rather catch the wrong person

17:37.480 --> 17:39.000
than miss any clues.

17:40.680 --> 17:42.030
Zhenzhu, over the years,

17:42.030 --> 17:44.090
you have become more and more steady.

17:44.310 --> 17:45.550
Zhenzhu is right.

17:45.880 --> 17:47.030
I also think

17:47.110 --> 17:48.270
that Li Qingyang seems

17:48.270 --> 17:50.440
to want to be caught
by the Divine Constable Bureau.

17:50.440 --> 17:51.240
Otherwise,

17:51.350 --> 17:52.680
why would he put a puppet doll

17:52.680 --> 17:53.790
in his own room

17:54.030 --> 17:56.030
and arouse suspicion for no reason?

17:57.680 --> 17:59.510
In just 3 years,

17:59.750 --> 18:00.750
Li Qingyang

18:00.880 --> 18:03.290
turned a desolate suburban area

18:03.510 --> 18:05.030
into a bustling paradise

18:05.030 --> 18:06.070
for the rich.

18:08.510 --> 18:10.270
He is

18:10.720 --> 18:12.440
indeed quite something.

18:12.880 --> 18:14.440
Chief, please instruct us

18:14.510 --> 18:16.170
on how we should deal with him.

18:17.960 --> 18:19.960
Take him to the interrogation room.

18:20.240 --> 18:21.970
No need for interrogation yet.

18:22.240 --> 18:23.030
Just

18:23.550 --> 18:25.400
don't guard him too closely.

18:26.790 --> 18:27.590
-Yes.
-Yes.

19:30.740 --> 19:33.000
[Tianshu Pavilion]

19:39.250 --> 19:41.260
[Tianshu Pavilion]

19:42.290 --> 19:43.090
[Tianshu Pavilion]

19:48.850 --> 19:51.530
[Tianshu Pavilion]

19:49.030 --> 19:50.830
So this is the Tianshu Pavilion.

19:51.240 --> 19:52.640
In the 72 years the Shi Dynasty

19:52.640 --> 19:53.900
has been established,

19:53.920 --> 19:55.920
all case files—big and small—

19:56.030 --> 19:57.480
and even secret anecdotes,

19:56.570 --> 19:58.250
[Tianshu Pavilion]

19:57.480 --> 19:58.880
are recorded here.

19:59.440 --> 20:00.590
I hope

20:00.880 --> 20:02.400
it holds the answers I'm looking for.

20:02.060 --> 20:04.360
[Tianshu Pavilion]

20:05.440 --> 20:07.030
Better to storm the King of Hell's Palace

20:07.030 --> 20:09.290
than enter the Divine Constable Bureau.

20:17.960 --> 20:18.750
You

20:19.030 --> 20:20.550
came to the wrong place.

20:23.750 --> 20:24.550
Strange.

20:24.830 --> 20:26.480
Why didn't I sense

20:26.480 --> 20:28.480
a trace of his inner energy just now?

20:31.070 --> 20:32.280
[Tianshu Pavilion]

20:35.430 --> 20:38.600
[Constable Ghost, Meng Rui]

20:40.750 --> 20:41.640
Someone once

20:41.640 --> 20:43.880
tried to break into the Tianshu Pavilion,

20:43.880 --> 20:45.240
but couldn't even climb over

20:45.240 --> 20:46.440
the Bureau's wall.

20:46.610 --> 20:48.180
[Tianshu Pavilion]

20:47.510 --> 20:48.680
You are different.

20:49.270 --> 20:51.310
You turned yourself in first,

20:51.830 --> 20:53.440
and then sought death.

20:54.750 --> 20:56.270
But to me,

20:56.960 --> 20:58.510
both methods

20:59.350 --> 21:00.590
are equally stupid.

21:00.990 --> 21:04.060
[Tianshu Pavilion]

21:01.550 --> 21:02.550
My Lord,

21:02.720 --> 21:03.960
why do you say that?

21:04.480 --> 21:06.160
I was invited by Constable Frost

21:06.160 --> 21:07.270
and Constable Eagle

21:07.270 --> 21:09.240
to have tea at your Bureau.

21:09.510 --> 21:11.710
Trespassing into the Tianshu Pavilion

21:11.920 --> 21:12.920
is punishable...

21:16.270 --> 21:17.160
by death.

21:17.010 --> 21:18.890
[Tianshu Pavilion]

21:18.200 --> 21:19.000
Don't.

21:19.350 --> 21:21.480
I haven't even been interrogated yet.

21:21.480 --> 21:22.830
I can't die yet.

21:34.030 --> 21:35.640
The sword is not yet unsheathed,

21:35.640 --> 21:36.720
but its aura has already

21:36.720 --> 21:38.250
spread for several meters.

21:38.480 --> 21:39.590
Could you be...

21:40.510 --> 21:41.770
Lord Constable Ghost?

21:42.160 --> 21:43.400
Surrender,

21:44.110 --> 21:45.840
and I'll spare you for a moment.

21:46.070 --> 21:48.000
You speak as if you've already won.

21:48.510 --> 21:50.400
We haven't started fighting yet.

21:50.550 --> 21:51.830
You asked for it.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.110
So stubborn!

23:09.720 --> 23:10.590
Illusion?

23:15.160 --> 23:24.350
[Tianshu Pavilion]

23:20.030 --> 23:21.110
People say

23:21.440 --> 23:22.550
that Constable Ghost's strike

23:22.550 --> 23:23.750
leaves no survivors.

23:31.270 --> 23:32.400
But this time,

23:33.070 --> 23:34.720
you missed.

23:37.680 --> 23:39.410
You are indeed quite skillful.

23:40.240 --> 23:41.500
Lord Constable Ghost,

23:42.160 --> 23:43.680
you started first.

23:44.270 --> 23:45.240
Now,

23:45.750 --> 23:47.480
let me show you mine.

23:57.880 --> 23:59.510
After 17 years of peace,

24:00.310 --> 24:02.550
the winds are finally rising.

24:11.270 --> 24:13.350
Heaven has eyes; Qian is above.

24:13.960 --> 24:16.620
Winds rise over the Capital;
Xun is at the flank.

24:19.820 --> 24:22.310
Qian over Xun;
forming the "Gou" Encounter.

24:23.720 --> 24:25.750
A star falls from the heavens;
the will defies fate.

24:25.750 --> 24:28.950
The world is swept by wind;
a mandate to the four quarters.

24:29.270 --> 24:30.630
Arrogant Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation

24:30.630 --> 24:32.590
[Arrogant Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation;
heaven meeting wind]

24:42.390 --> 24:44.420
They say in Tianhuang City,

24:44.450 --> 24:46.790
only the Divine Constable Bureau
can use strange arts.

24:46.790 --> 24:48.960
It seems true.

24:48.960 --> 24:51.240
This fight with you

24:51.260 --> 24:52.600
was really thrilling.

24:57.430 --> 25:00.090
[In the Shi Dynasty's
37th year of Hongyun,]

25:00.160 --> 25:01.540
[Several children went missing
one after another]

25:01.540 --> 25:03.720
[in Suzhou's Doudou County.]

25:04.480 --> 25:05.920
[According to the witness,]

25:05.920 --> 25:08.550
[a puppet doll appeared.]

26:06.960 --> 26:11.540
[Tianhuang City outskirts,
Underworld Market]

26:12.880 --> 26:14.480
Pull harder! Pull!

26:17.110 --> 26:18.110
Young Master is here!

26:18.110 --> 26:18.960
Young Master!

26:19.550 --> 26:21.110
Young Master, you look great.

26:21.110 --> 26:22.720
So elegant and stylish.

26:22.720 --> 26:24.440
Young Master, this Dragon Snake Gall

26:24.440 --> 26:26.070
has 60 years of cultivation.

26:26.090 --> 26:26.920
Divine weapon—

26:26.920 --> 26:27.920
Gan Jiang and Mo Ye!

26:27.920 --> 26:28.640
If you don't like it,

26:28.640 --> 26:29.750
I have the Invincible Tai'e too.

26:29.750 --> 26:30.720
It's definitely—

26:30.720 --> 26:33.350
Don't miss it as you pass by.

26:33.640 --> 26:36.030
These are the results
of my lifelong medical practice,

26:36.030 --> 26:38.720
made with my life's effort.

26:38.920 --> 26:40.440
Dragon-Eye Rabbit Liver.

26:40.480 --> 26:42.080
It's concentrated essence.

26:42.440 --> 26:43.510
I want it!

26:43.590 --> 26:44.400
Slowly.

26:45.270 --> 26:46.480
Slowly, slowly.

26:46.480 --> 26:48.640
Hundred-Year-Old Dragon-Eye Rabbit Liver.

26:48.640 --> 26:50.900
It's 3 taels of gold
and 3 taels of silver.

26:52.510 --> 26:53.680
Slowly.

26:54.480 --> 26:55.270
Slowly—

26:58.070 --> 26:59.420
Young Master.

27:03.200 --> 27:04.070
How is it? Does it work?

27:04.070 --> 27:04.790
How is it?

27:04.810 --> 27:06.000
Does it work?

27:06.020 --> 27:07.250
Does it work?

27:07.510 --> 27:08.440
Tell us quickly.

27:09.510 --> 27:10.790
What a petty trick.

27:11.720 --> 27:13.050
It's just a painkiller.

27:13.510 --> 27:15.310
Instead of letting you cheat people here,

27:15.310 --> 27:16.840
you might as well let me have it cheap.

27:16.840 --> 27:18.010
So it was a lie.

27:18.110 --> 27:19.570
These are fake medicines?

27:20.310 --> 27:22.310
They're not. They're not!

27:22.790 --> 27:23.720
They're not.

27:23.780 --> 27:25.920
I'll just compensate you.

27:25.920 --> 27:26.640
Pay up!

27:27.310 --> 27:28.670
I'll compensate you.

27:29.730 --> 27:32.600
Pay up!

27:32.630 --> 27:34.590
Pay us!

27:34.640 --> 27:35.480
Don't think that because of this,

27:35.480 --> 27:36.160
you don't have to pay!

27:36.160 --> 27:37.030
What's wrong?

27:37.920 --> 27:39.480
Let's go back to the clinic first.

27:39.480 --> 27:40.880
You really make me worry.

27:47.240 --> 27:47.920
Bear with it.

27:47.920 --> 27:48.880
It'll hurt.

27:49.960 --> 27:50.750
Lighter!

27:51.070 --> 27:52.440
Okay, almost done.

27:59.960 --> 28:01.000
Constable Ghost's Reaper Sword

28:01.000 --> 28:02.860
truly lives up to its reputation.

28:03.030 --> 28:04.110
If your clone hadn't

28:04.110 --> 28:05.970
drawn away most of his sword aura,

28:06.110 --> 28:07.750
you would be dead by now.

28:06.340 --> 28:09.650
[Li San]

28:08.680 --> 28:10.140
You are not careful at all.

28:13.880 --> 28:15.160
It's just a flesh wound.

28:15.160 --> 28:16.030
It's fine.

28:19.510 --> 28:20.350
If I had known,

28:20.750 --> 28:22.110
I shouldn't have mentioned the

28:22.110 --> 28:24.240
missing girls case in Tianhuang City.

28:24.720 --> 28:26.640
Hearing about puppet dolls,

28:27.920 --> 28:29.830
you acted like you went crazy.

28:29.880 --> 28:30.740
Look at you now—

28:30.880 --> 28:34.140
you made yourself a suspect
trying to investigate things.

28:34.350 --> 28:36.030
That was also my own plan,

28:36.270 --> 28:37.070
okay?

28:37.070 --> 28:37.720
Sure.

28:38.030 --> 28:39.070
You are great.

28:39.920 --> 28:41.000
All right, almost done.

28:41.000 --> 28:41.960
Almost done.

28:43.110 --> 28:45.030
Once the Severe-Cold Sword is drawn,

28:45.030 --> 28:46.030
someone must die.

28:46.720 --> 28:49.180
This is the rule set by you,
Constable Ghost.

28:49.750 --> 28:50.890
But tonight,

28:51.110 --> 28:52.550
to execute my order,

28:52.550 --> 28:53.880
you broke your rule.

28:54.030 --> 28:55.310
I must've put you on the spot.

28:55.310 --> 28:56.970
The method the opponent used,

28:57.110 --> 28:58.130
taking Bagua as the formation

28:58.130 --> 28:59.550
and the Five Elements as weapons,

28:59.550 --> 29:00.310
was incredibly powerful—

29:00.310 --> 29:01.550
something I've never seen.

29:01.550 --> 29:02.640
I feel

29:03.240 --> 29:04.960
they didn't use
their full strength either.

29:04.960 --> 29:06.160
You mean

29:06.960 --> 29:09.030
he is the one who actually held back?

29:09.790 --> 29:10.590
That's right.

29:13.430 --> 29:14.550
In your opinion,

29:14.960 --> 29:16.110
why would he risk his life

29:16.110 --> 29:17.960
to barge into the Tianshu Pavilion?

29:17.960 --> 29:18.920
I don't know.

29:19.160 --> 29:20.270
17 years ago,

29:20.350 --> 29:21.440
the last thing I saw

29:21.920 --> 29:23.450
at the Mulan Hunting Ground

29:23.550 --> 29:25.070
was a puppet doll.

29:41.880 --> 29:42.680
Now

29:43.070 --> 29:45.160
puppet dolls have reappeared
in Tianhuang City,

29:45.160 --> 29:45.960
I think

29:46.350 --> 29:47.960
there must be some connection

29:47.960 --> 29:49.510
between these two.

29:58.350 --> 29:59.550
Seventeen years ago,

30:00.030 --> 30:01.690
after my death was announced,

30:02.270 --> 30:04.110
the former Chief, Lu Chong,

30:04.310 --> 30:05.840
was dismissed from office.

30:06.110 --> 30:07.110
So I guess

30:07.550 --> 30:09.640
the Divine Constable Bureau
must be involved

30:09.640 --> 30:12.440
in what happened 17 years ago.

30:13.510 --> 30:15.710
The files related to that year's events

30:15.750 --> 30:17.000
should also be locked in

30:17.000 --> 30:19.800
the Divine Constable Bureau's
Tianshu Pavilion.

30:23.350 --> 30:25.110
I almost got in.

30:26.420 --> 30:27.680
Who would have thought

30:28.110 --> 30:30.840
Constable Gui
would come out of nowhere halfway.

30:31.520 --> 30:32.800
So what if you find out

30:32.830 --> 30:33.880
the truth?

30:35.070 --> 30:37.870
Back then,
the darn emperor announced to the world

30:38.070 --> 30:40.070
that the Fourth Prince, Zhou Yan...

30:41.490 --> 30:42.550
was dead.

30:43.400 --> 30:45.350
You are now my disciple,

30:45.720 --> 30:46.550
Li Si.

30:55.610 --> 30:57.680
It's been 17 years.

31:04.250 --> 31:06.040
[ Emperor Qi Huai, the God of Yan]

31:20.020 --> 31:27.030
[King Qi Huai of the Great World]

31:25.270 --> 31:27.240
I gave you a choice back then.

31:27.510 --> 31:28.440
I can't do it.

31:31.830 --> 31:33.070
For these 17 years,

31:34.070 --> 31:35.730
there hasn't been a single day

31:35.830 --> 31:37.560
I didn't want to know the truth.

31:41.480 --> 31:42.340
Over the years,

31:44.270 --> 31:47.350
I learned martial arts, did business,

31:48.070 --> 31:49.680
and opened the Star-Gathering Pavilion

31:49.680 --> 31:51.610
to collect various intelligence.

31:51.960 --> 31:53.750
As Young Master Qingyang,

31:53.960 --> 31:55.960
I also befriended the Crown Prince.

31:56.480 --> 31:57.510
I did all this

31:58.440 --> 32:00.070
to find out exactly

32:01.350 --> 32:02.790
who wanted to harm me

32:02.790 --> 32:03.960
back then,

32:04.510 --> 32:05.680
and who

32:06.480 --> 32:07.550
abducted me.

32:10.480 --> 32:12.160
I must find out

32:12.960 --> 32:14.680
what exactly happened

32:14.680 --> 32:15.960
17 years ago

32:17.240 --> 32:18.920
at the Mulan Hunting Ground.

32:21.550 --> 32:22.350
I...

32:23.830 --> 32:25.550
will never let all this

32:26.350 --> 32:28.160
remain up in the air.

33:00.660 --> 33:02.450
Young Master Qingyang...

33:03.630 --> 33:06.490
What does what happened
at the Mulan Hunting Ground

33:07.530 --> 33:09.990
17 years ago have to do with you?

33:14.780 --> 33:17.110
[The Great Qi Huai, God of Yan]

33:19.510 --> 33:21.350
I want to go home!

33:24.110 --> 33:27.550
I want to go home!

33:28.370 --> 33:29.440
Where are you?

33:30.160 --> 33:32.240
Where are you?
I want to go home.

33:32.550 --> 33:35.830
I want to go home!

33:36.130 --> 33:39.200
I want to go home!

33:42.750 --> 33:44.640
I want to go home.
Tell me.

33:45.510 --> 33:48.680
Who did this to you? Don't go.
I want to go home.

33:48.680 --> 33:49.350
Don't go.

33:50.550 --> 33:51.350
Don't go!

33:51.750 --> 33:52.550
Don't go!

34:11.440 --> 34:12.840
This old geezer.

34:13.760 --> 34:15.560
Where did he put the Qilin blood?

34:15.760 --> 34:17.320
Master, Master!

34:17.960 --> 34:19.110
I just got news that

34:19.110 --> 34:20.190
the Divine Constable Bureau's men

34:20.190 --> 34:20.920
went out the west city gate

34:20.920 --> 34:22.980
and headed straight for Bugui Manor!

34:24.800 --> 34:26.600
Keep it down.

34:27.710 --> 34:29.070
He finally fell asleep.

34:29.070 --> 34:30.550
What if you wake him up?

34:30.670 --> 34:31.760
If you let him know,

34:31.760 --> 34:33.820
he'll rise from the dead, believe it?

34:34.760 --> 34:36.150
He did! He just did!

34:43.360 --> 34:44.360
Stop right there.

34:45.960 --> 34:47.090
Where are you going?

34:47.550 --> 34:48.510
To Bugui Manor.

34:50.550 --> 34:53.550
Going to mess with
the Divine Constable Bureau again?

34:53.960 --> 34:54.760
Master,

34:56.440 --> 34:58.710
the Divine Constable Bureau
making such a big move

34:58.710 --> 35:00.710
must mean some progress in the case.

35:01.230 --> 35:02.230
As you know,

35:02.440 --> 35:03.550
this is the only clue

35:03.550 --> 35:05.080
to finding the puppet doll.

35:05.670 --> 35:06.930
I want to solve the case

35:07.440 --> 35:08.760
even more than they do.

35:10.920 --> 35:11.960
You can't stop me.

35:17.110 --> 35:18.440
You're injured,

35:18.550 --> 35:20.550
and you have an old heart condition.

35:21.920 --> 35:24.230
The Arrogant Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation—

35:24.230 --> 35:26.550
you must never use it again.

35:41.440 --> 35:42.360
I know.

35:42.840 --> 35:43.670
Don't worry,

35:44.030 --> 35:45.280
I'll be fine.

35:46.280 --> 35:48.110
I must live well

35:48.440 --> 35:51.440
so I can take care of you in your old age
and send you off.

35:52.670 --> 35:53.480
I'm off.

35:55.510 --> 35:57.640
You remember that quite clearly, huh!

35:59.960 --> 36:00.760
Remember!

36:00.920 --> 36:02.450
You must never use it again!

36:13.920 --> 36:15.810
An inescapable net, no way to fly!

36:37.550 --> 36:38.360
Lord Constable Frost,

36:38.360 --> 36:39.190
informants say

36:39.190 --> 36:39.960
it was here

36:39.960 --> 36:42.020
that the missing girls were spotted.

36:43.800 --> 36:44.440
Search!

36:44.460 --> 36:45.270
Yes.

36:50.630 --> 36:52.290
All the bodies found are here.

36:52.430 --> 36:53.830
These should be

36:53.860 --> 36:55.230
the 9 missing girls.

36:56.320 --> 36:58.110
No trace of the suspect
was found at the scene.

36:58.110 --> 36:59.110
But judging from

36:59.110 --> 37:00.110
the solid wax drippings,

37:00.110 --> 37:02.110
the person in the room has long gone.

37:02.460 --> 37:03.960
Nine girls.

37:04.550 --> 37:06.350
The oldest was just 20 years old.

37:07.150 --> 37:08.360
Why on earth did the killer

37:08.360 --> 37:10.110
kill these girls?

37:10.960 --> 37:11.710
Do they have

37:11.710 --> 37:13.320
anything in common?

37:21.260 --> 37:22.750
On-site autopsy?

37:35.510 --> 37:37.070
There were no wounds
on the victims' bodies

37:37.070 --> 37:38.480
nor any strangulation marks.

37:38.480 --> 37:39.280
But

37:39.970 --> 37:42.220
they died
from being drained of all their blood.

37:42.220 --> 37:43.550
Drained of their blood?

37:43.710 --> 37:44.760
No wonder they looked

37:44.760 --> 37:45.920
so terrifyingly pale.

37:45.920 --> 37:46.800
But why did the killer

37:46.800 --> 37:47.920
drain their blood?

37:48.520 --> 37:49.960
-Once drained of blood,
-Once drained of blood,

37:49.960 --> 37:53.690
-the bodies wouldn't rot easily.
-the bodies wouldn't rot easily.

37:54.920 --> 37:56.150
But what did the killer

37:56.150 --> 37:57.150
want to do

37:57.150 --> 37:58.210
with their bodies?

37:58.960 --> 38:00.220
Lord Constable Frost!

38:02.360 --> 38:03.320
Lord Constable Frost,

38:03.320 --> 38:04.230
a silk thread was found

38:04.230 --> 38:05.560
on the floor of the room.

38:08.840 --> 38:09.630
This thread

38:09.630 --> 38:11.960
seems to be used for controlling puppets.

38:12.070 --> 38:13.320
In that case,

38:13.480 --> 38:15.140
the witnesses told the truth.

38:15.150 --> 38:16.840
It was indeed a puppeteer

38:16.840 --> 38:18.300
who abducted these girls.

38:22.280 --> 38:23.540
What's wrong, My Lord?

38:24.440 --> 38:25.370
This silk thread

38:25.710 --> 38:27.360
has a peculiar fragrance.

38:27.510 --> 38:28.880
A peculiar fragrance?

38:31.880 --> 38:32.670
Indeed.

38:33.360 --> 38:34.360
It's very unique.

38:34.500 --> 38:37.230
I have never smelled
something like this before.

38:37.410 --> 38:38.440
The girls were

38:38.440 --> 38:40.240
drained of their blood to death.

38:40.330 --> 38:41.330
I got it.

39:00.480 --> 39:01.280
Stop!

40:08.840 --> 40:10.100
Lord Constable Frost.

40:10.880 --> 40:11.880
Are you

40:11.960 --> 40:13.680
feeling guilty toward those girls

40:13.680 --> 40:15.780
because you're unable
to catch the real killer,

40:15.780 --> 40:16.610
so

40:16.960 --> 40:19.110
you were trapped by the illusion just now

40:19.110 --> 40:20.510
and willing to be bound?

40:21.030 --> 40:21.880
Li Qingyang.

40:22.480 --> 40:23.810
You escaped last night,

40:23.880 --> 40:25.920
but today you walked right into the trap.

40:25.920 --> 40:27.580
You're wrong, Your Lordship.

40:27.880 --> 40:28.960
I am here today

40:29.180 --> 40:31.050
to help you investigate the case.

40:31.150 --> 40:32.150
I've seen

40:32.150 --> 40:33.750
your skills with my own eyes.

40:33.960 --> 40:35.230
The illusion just now

40:35.440 --> 40:36.440
was your doing.

40:40.710 --> 40:42.070
You found out.

40:43.480 --> 40:44.280
That's right.

40:44.760 --> 40:46.320
It was indeed my doing.

40:46.960 --> 40:49.150
With so many Divine Constables
in the manor,

40:49.150 --> 40:50.320
I didn't want

40:50.360 --> 40:51.760
them to swarm up

40:51.760 --> 40:53.670
and tie me up.

40:53.960 --> 40:54.760
So,

40:55.070 --> 40:56.880
I had to use an illusion

40:57.070 --> 40:58.550
to invite you here

40:58.630 --> 41:00.290
to discuss the case together.

41:01.360 --> 41:03.170
Not only did you appear
at the murder scene

41:03.170 --> 41:04.550
and interfere with the investigation,

41:04.550 --> 41:06.760
but a puppet doll
was also found in your room.

41:06.760 --> 41:07.670
No matter how I look at it,

41:07.670 --> 41:08.550
you are the prime suspect.

41:08.550 --> 41:09.710
Yet you say you're helping me investigate?

41:09.710 --> 41:11.070
Don't you think it sounds like
a thief crying "catch the thief"?

41:11.070 --> 41:11.760
Stop.

41:14.480 --> 41:16.140
Whether you believe it or not,

41:16.630 --> 41:18.630
I share the same desire as the bureau

41:18.760 --> 41:20.510
to solve the case.

41:20.880 --> 41:21.880
Cut the crap.

41:21.880 --> 41:23.150
Come with me to face justice.

41:23.150 --> 41:24.010
Your Lordship.

41:24.920 --> 41:26.150
There are thousands of ways

41:26.150 --> 41:27.320
to kill in this world.

41:27.320 --> 41:28.930
Have you ever wondered

41:28.950 --> 41:30.910
why the killer specifically chose

41:30.940 --> 41:32.800
to drain their blood?

41:33.280 --> 41:34.110
When we get back to the bureau,

41:34.110 --> 41:35.510
you can talk all you want.

41:38.150 --> 41:40.230
"Hibiscus pales beside a beauty's blood;

41:40.230 --> 41:43.110
refined nine times,
even dead bones turn sweet.

41:43.630 --> 41:45.030
I wonder if Your Lordship

41:45.030 --> 41:46.550
has heard of this saying.

41:48.320 --> 41:49.780
The Strange Medicines Chapter

41:49.780 --> 41:51.670
of the Tianshu Pavilion's
Pharmacology Volume reads:

41:51.670 --> 41:53.230
"Hibiscus pales beside a beauty's blood;

41:53.230 --> 41:55.360
refined nine times,
even dead bones turn sweet."

41:55.360 --> 41:56.590
Legend has it
that this exotic Dead Bone Spice

41:56.590 --> 41:57.480
is extremely rare

41:57.480 --> 42:00.210
and must be refined
with the blood of young girls.

42:14.770 --> 42:16.230
Who says the killer
drains the murdered girls' blood

42:16.230 --> 42:17.670
to preserve the bodies?

42:17.670 --> 42:18.280
Their goal

42:18.280 --> 42:19.550
is not their bodies,

42:19.550 --> 42:20.670
but their blood.

42:21.480 --> 42:22.550
The killer drains their blood

42:22.550 --> 42:24.280
to refine this Dead Bone Spice.

42:24.320 --> 42:26.850
No wonder
there's a scent on the silk threads.

42:30.440 --> 42:31.440
Now it seems,

42:31.480 --> 42:33.540
the Dead Bone Spice in Huangquan Market

42:33.540 --> 42:36.070
was sold out overnight.

42:36.520 --> 42:38.480
Now it's hard
to find even a single bottle,

42:38.480 --> 42:39.940
making it worth a fortune.

42:42.320 --> 42:43.480
Lord Constable Frost,

42:43.480 --> 42:44.280
do you think

42:44.760 --> 42:46.670
the killer might be killing

42:46.760 --> 42:48.070
to create this spice

42:48.150 --> 42:50.320
for huge profits?

42:50.320 --> 42:51.920
If you knew how hard it is

42:51.920 --> 42:52.550
to create this spice,

42:52.550 --> 42:53.840
you wouldn't think so.

42:54.670 --> 42:55.630
To create this spice,

42:55.630 --> 42:56.760
the collected blood

42:56.840 --> 42:58.150
must be from a young girl

42:58.150 --> 42:59.480
with a pure Yin destiny.

43:00.150 --> 43:01.150
In the entire Tianhuang City,

43:01.150 --> 43:02.550
there are very few such people.

43:02.550 --> 43:04.150
To find 9 such girls,

43:04.150 --> 43:06.550
the killer must have
gone to great lengths.

43:08.550 --> 43:11.150
Blood of a young girl
with a pure Yin destiny...

43:14.710 --> 43:15.510
Qing Wu.

43:17.230 --> 43:18.030
Oh no.

43:35.550 --> 43:36.320
Qing Wu!

43:37.360 --> 43:38.150
Qing Wu!

43:42.550 --> 43:43.360
I'm sorry.

43:44.440 --> 43:45.440
I came too late.

43:46.840 --> 43:47.630
These

43:47.710 --> 43:49.440
are all the dowry gifts for you.

43:49.550 --> 43:50.630
I hope

43:50.630 --> 43:52.560
that in the future, you could find a

43:53.670 --> 43:55.310
better home

43:55.550 --> 43:57.350
than Star-Gathering Pavilion.

44:27.280 --> 44:29.550
She also died
from having her blood drained.

44:29.550 --> 44:30.840
Did you see the killer?

44:31.760 --> 44:33.960
She was originally going to get married

44:34.510 --> 44:36.370
on the second day of next month...

44:49.150 --> 44:49.960
The killer

44:50.070 --> 44:51.270
should still be here.

44:57.440 --> 44:58.240
Take her away.

44:58.320 --> 44:58.960
Yes.

45:02.110 --> 45:03.150
Jiang Zhan, Ding Mao.

45:03.150 --> 45:03.590
My Lord.

45:03.590 --> 45:04.920
Search
the Star-Gathering Pavilion thoroughly,

45:04.920 --> 45:06.280
and report back immediately
if you find anything unusual.

45:06.280 --> 45:07.070
Yes.
Yes.

45:13.320 --> 45:14.150
Li Qingyang!

45:17.920 --> 45:19.440
If you leave now,

45:19.440 --> 45:21.000
you'll be fleeing to avoid punishment.

45:21.000 --> 45:22.150
Although you didn't kill Qing Wu,

45:22.150 --> 45:23.620
you are still a suspect.

45:23.710 --> 45:24.550
Come back with me quickly

45:24.550 --> 45:25.880
and explain it clearly.

45:30.480 --> 45:31.480
What suspicion?

45:32.150 --> 45:33.230
I don't care.

45:34.760 --> 45:35.550
Since they laid hands on

45:35.550 --> 45:37.330
someone from the Star-Gathering Pavilion,

45:37.330 --> 45:39.240
they must pay the price.

45:51.390 --> 45:52.870
I will settle this score

45:54.230 --> 45:56.480
of what they did to Qing Wu.

46:01.230 --> 46:02.030
Li Si!
